"marketing/kiki/mascot_20150812_kif_scott_cover)"

#: content/en/about/mascot.md:155
msgid "**Cover for Digital Painting with KRITA 2.9 (2015)**"
msgstr "**Kovro por Cifereca Pentrado kun KRITA 2.9 (2015)**"

#: content/en/about/mascot.md:157
msgid ""
"**Artist comment:** This is the cover I created for Scott Petrovic's book: "
"[Digital Painting with KRITA 2.9](https://www.amazon.com/Digital-Painting-"
"KRITA-2-9-Masterpiece/dp/0996851704). After the major design change in 2014, "
"I tried to introduce some mech details back to Kiki's then over-simplified "
"character design. Still not very \"cyber\" though. The focus of this picture "
"was the attempt to draw the background."
msgstr ""
"**Artista komento:** Jen la kovrilo, kiun mi kreis por la libro de Scott "
"Petrovic: [Digital Painting with KRITA 2.9](https://www.amazon.com/Digital-"
"Painting-KRITA-2-9-Masterpiece/dp/ 0996851704). Post la grava dezajnŝanĝo en "
"2014, mi provis enkonduki kelkajn meĥajn detalojn reen al la tiam tro "
"simpligita karakter-dezajno de Kiki. Ankoraŭ ne tre \"kiber\" tamen. La "
"fokuso de ĉi tiu bildo estis la provo desegni la fonon."

